      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "©2012, The Authors. Journal compilation ©2012 Wiley Periodicals, Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "Atrial flutter (AFL) is a common arrhythmia that is associated with postpericardiotomy and pericarditis. The relationship of AFL with tamponade has rarely been reported. A case of AFL with acute pericarditis and cardiac tamponade is thus presented here."
      },
